#para(((emph: "bold", text: "Charms"), (emph: "", text: " include scrolls, stones and gems, and provide temporary effects with a limited number of uses.")))
#para(((emph: "bold", text: "Relics"), (emph: "", text: " include tomes, cloaks, rings and familiars, and provide magical abilities or utility effects.")))
